label "Sustainability signal plane publish and consume symmetry diagram"
canvas 460 250
text 14 18 "each serves /.well-known/sustainability-data" size=11 left
box sysa 14 30 150 40 "system A|publishes its data"
box sysb 14 96 150 40 "system B|publishes its data"
box sysc 14 162 150 40 "system C|publishes its data"
box agent 290 80 150 60 "consuming agent|reads peers, decides" acc
box own 290 172 150 40 "publishes its own|at the same path"
arrow sysa agent
arrow sysb agent
arrow sysc agent
arrow agent own
note "every node is both reporter and sensor"
